                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN UND VORRICHTUNG FÜR SIDELINK-RESSOURCENAUSSCHLUSS ZUR VORRICHTUNGSINTERNEN KOORDINATION IN DER DRAHTLOSEN KOMMUNIKATION</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉS ET APPAREIL D'EXCLUSION DE RESSOURCES DE LIAISON LATÉRALE POUR COORDINATION INTRA-DISPOSITIF DANS UNE COMMUNICATION SANS FIL</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">METHODS AND APPARATUS FOR SIDELINK RESOURCE EXCLUSION FOR INTRA-DEVICE COORDINATION IN WIRELESS COMMUNICATION</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method that determines a resource at a first user equipment (UE) for a sidelink communication from the second UE to a first UE is described. In an exemplary embodiment, the method receives a request from the second UE to send data to the first UE. In addition, the method determines a preconfigured resource selection window that is used by the second UE. Furthermore, the method determines a first sensing result at the first UE. The determined first sensing result includes information to be reported to the second UE for a resource selection. The determined first sensing results has a plurality of first sensing types. Further, the method transmits the first sensing result from the first UE to the second UE.</p>
            </abstract>
